<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>BREAKING: MRI confirms Grade 1 PCL sprain for Vernell Brown III</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>The mildest grade. Sources told GatorBait he may not miss any games.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#14243D" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" />
      <mj-button background-color="#FA4616" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0" inner-padding="13px 20px" font-size="13px" font-weight="800" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#F2F0EB" width="640px">
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 24px 12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=breaking_brown_2026_09_27&utm_content=masthead" style="text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:900 32px/1 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#003B7A;letter-spacing:-1.5px;">GATOR<span style="color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span></div></a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#C8102E" padding="10px 24px">
      <mj-column><mj-text align="center" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="13px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="3px" padding="0">BREAKING NEWS</mj-text></mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="22px 26px 10px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_7acdfecf6f3d45289bbdcc93f3ca970c~mv2.jpg" alt="Vernell Brown III runs down the sideline against Ole Miss. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/breaking-vernell-brown-mri-grade-1-pcl-sprain-florida-gators?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=breaking_brown_2026_09_27&utm_content=photo" padding="0 0 6px" />
        <mj-text font-size="11px" color="#6D7888" padding="0 0 14px">Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/breaking-vernell-brown-mri-grade-1-pcl-sprain-florida-gators?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=breaking_brown_2026_09_27&utm_content=headline" style="text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 28px/1.12 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">MRI confirms Grade 1 PCL sprain for Gators WR Vernell Brown III</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px">An MRI confirmed the initial diagnosis of a Grade 1 PCL sprain in Brown’s knee, sources told GatorBait. It’s the mildest grade. Sources say Brown shouldn’t miss many games, and possibly none at all.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 18px">Playing Saturday at No. 25 Missouri may be a bit ambitious, sources said, but the door isn’t closed. Brown leads Florida with 17 catches for 271 yards and two touchdowns.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/breaking-vernell-brown-mri-grade-1-pcl-sprain-florida-gators?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=breaking_brown_2026_09_27&utm_content=read" align="left" padding="0 0 8px">READ THE FULL STORY →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
